# E-Commerce Sales, Customer and Delivery Analytics (Olist, real data)

**Live dashboard:** {{ pages_url }} · **Data:** Olist Brazilian E-Commerce public dataset, {{ k.orders | num }} real orders, Jan 2017 to Aug 2018

> **Headline: growth has stalled because the business only acquires.** Jan-Aug revenue grew {{ t.yoy_revenue_growth | pct(0) }} year on year,
> but the 2018 monthly run-rate is flat (May-Aug averaged {{ e.avg_monthly_revenue_2018_may_aug | brl }} a month against
> {{ e.avg_monthly_revenue_2018_jan_apr | brl }} in Jan-Apr). New customers stopped growing at about {{ e.avg_new_customers_2018 | num }} a month,
> only {{ k.repeat_rate | pct }} of customers ever order twice, and late deliveries cut the average review from {{ d.ontime_avg_review | sig }}
> to {{ d.late_avg_review | sig }} stars. Three actions below are worth an estimated **{{ i.total_revenue | brl }} a year**
> ({{ i.total_share_of_annual | pct }} of annualised 2018 revenue) under stated assumptions.

